      <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.35; margin-bottom: 18px;">Statutory RTO Paperwork, Transit Marine Insurance &amp; Delivery Handover for Bike Transport from Bangalore</h2>
      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">Shipping a two-wheeler from Bangalore to Mysore is a seamless process for those who understand the regulatory landscape.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 16px 0 20px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;"><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>While the distance is relatively short, the legal requirements for interstate vehicle transport are strict.</span></li><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>Failure to present the correct documentation can lead to immediate seizure of the consignment by transport authorities or significant delays at the checkpoint.</span></li></ul>
<p>For every rider planning this route, the foundation of a successful shipment lies in having a meticulously prepared document set. Do not leave these items to the last minute; gather them before the pickup truck arrives at your doorstep.</p>

<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">The primary document you must possess is the <strong>self-attested photocopy of the Registration Certificate (RC)</strong>.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 16px 0 20px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;"><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>This serves as the legal proof of ownership.</span></li><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>When transporting a vehicle across state lines, the transporter must verify that the person signing the consignment note is the registered owner.</span></li><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>Your signature on the RC copy must match the signature on the vehicle registration document.</span></li></ul>
<p>If you have recently purchased the bike, ensure the RC has been updated in your name. Otherwise, you must provide a valid sale agreement along with the RC of the previous owner. Having this document ready prevents any interrogation by police or transport officials during the journey.</p>

<p>Equally critical is the <strong>current Pollution Under Control (PUC) certificate</strong> and a <strong>valid insurance certificate</strong>. Although the bike is not being driven on the road, it is being transported as a cargo item. Authorities at the Bangalore-Mysore highway checkpoints often verify these documents to ensure the vehicle is roadworthy and legally insured.</p>
<p>An expired PUC certificate is a common reason for consignment holds. Ensure your PUC is valid for at least the duration of the transport and a few days afterward. The insurance certificate should be current, showing no lapses.</p>

<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">Finally, the <strong>IBA-approved consignment bilty</strong> is the master document for your shipment.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 16px 0 20px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;"><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>This bill of lading details the sender, receiver, and the vehicle particulars.</span></li><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>It acts as a legal contract between you and the transport agency.</span></li><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>When the bike reaches Mysore, the receiver must present the original bilty to claim the vehicle.</span></li><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>Without this document, the delivery agent cannot hand over the keys.</span></li></ul>

<p>For complete peace of mind, we strongly recommend opting for <strong>100% declared-value marine transit insurance</strong>. While standard transport insurance covers third-party liability, marine transit insurance covers the actual value of your bike in the event of an accident, theft, or damage during transit.</p>
<p>Declaring the full value of your vehicle ensures that if any mishap occurs, you receive a full replacement amount rather than a depreciated payout. This coverage is affordable and provides a safety net for your valuable asset.</p></div>
