    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Upon arrival, the vehicle is examined under natural light to accurately compare its present state with the pickup photographs. Inspectors check the bodywork, paint finish, lights, mirrors, tires, and any accessories. Any new scratches, dents, or missing parts are recorded, and discrepancies with the original photos are highlighted for immediate resolution.</p>
