    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #10b98122; color: #10b981; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">02</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Odometer Verification:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">The current odometer reading is read directly from the instrument cluster and cross‑checked with the mileage noted on the Load Receipt (LR) bilty. This step confirms that the vehicle has not been tampered with during transit and that the mileage reported to the consignee is precise.</p>
